---
description: IR with the railroad config section set (spacing, arcs, markers and colours).
config:
  railroad:
    padding: 16
    verticalSeparation: 12
    horizontalSeparation: 20
    arcRadius: 6
    markerRadius: 4
    strokeWidth: 1
    terminalFill: '#E0F0FF'
    nonTerminalFill: '#FFF8E0'
    lineColor: '#333366'
---
railroad-beta
list = sequence(terminal("["), optional(sequence(nonterminal("item"), zeroOrMore(sequence(terminal(","), nonterminal("item"))))), terminal("]")) ;
